WEBVTT

00:08:29.171 --> 00:08:32.299
is because of that crazy
permit that I had,

00:08:32.299 --> 00:08:34.635
I literally walked in
without being searched.

00:08:34.635 --> 00:08:36.345
I had my phone on me.

00:08:36.345 --> 00:08:40.349
So I started filming in there
and posting it on social media.

00:08:40.683 --> 00:08:43.978
So this guy there was showing me
his tattoo on day one.

00:08:44.353 --> 00:08:47.064
And then the evening, he called
his family and they said,

00:08:47.064 --> 00:08:48.649
"We saw you on JR's Instagram.

00:08:48.691 --> 00:08:51.026
It's incredible, we see
what you guys are doing."

00:08:51.068 --> 00:08:52.861
He was so proud the next day he said,

00:08:52.903 --> 00:08:55.281
"JR, do you mind me showing my diplomas?"

00:08:55.281 --> 00:08:58.367
They started realizing the impact
of suddenly having a connection

00:08:58.367 --> 00:08:59.785
with the outside.

00:08:59.827 --> 00:09:01.370
Then this guy showed up.